{"case_id": "female_19800921_P007-Q35", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主毕业后从事什么行业？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "A", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字庚申、乙酉、丁酉、乙巳，日主丁火生于酉月，财星当令，地支申酉酉三会金局，时支巳火又被酉金合化，金旺财多，日主身弱。天干双透乙木偏印贴身，为用神。印主文教、学术，丁火文明，亦有讲师之象。日主坐酉，酉为文昌贵人，增其文采。毕业后适逢壬午大运，壬水正官合身，午火禄神助身，午为乙木印星之长生，利于文化教育事业，故最可能成为中学教师。八字财旺却身弱，若从事会计（金）或经商（财）则易为财所累；无食伤生财，房屋经纪不符；原局官星不显，大运官来合身，虽有机会担任主管，但初入职场更宜先从教职起步。因此推断为教师。\n\n最终答案：A", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "female_19800921_P007-Q35", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2024_b1a_prime_R0_P4_G4\\details_2024_b1a_prime_R0_P4_G4.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 39295, "response_id": "b3b751ea-917f-4436-b516-fdb8d939a379", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 205, "completion_tokens": 2057, "total_tokens": 2262, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 1837}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 77}}
{"case_id": "male_20070131_P008-Q36", "domain": "health", "question": "请问命主在一岁前被诊断出那一种疾病？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字分析：乙木日主生于丑月，天寒地冻，地支三土（戌、丑、丑）一辰，土势厚重，日主衰弱。天干丙辛合化水，用神丙火被合受损，火主心脏与血脉；地支丑戌相刑，火库受破，丙火根基动摇。一岁前行辛丑大运，流年丁亥，丁火虚透又被亥水所克，水旺火熄，加重原局火衰之象。火在年干为心脏，被水合克并有缺损之征，故先天心脏结构易有异常，诊断心脏有孔最为吻合。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 0.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "male_20070131_P008-Q36", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2024_b1a_prime_R0_P4_G4\\details_2024_b1a_prime_R0_P4_G4.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 104472, "response_id": "52aa92bc-0649-4632-8ea7-2aa23757e4c2", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 217, "completion_tokens": 4869, "total_tokens": 5086, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 4719}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 0, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 217}}
{"case_id": "male_20070131_P008-Q37", "domain": "wealth", "question": "此命主的出身贫或富？", "expected_answer": "C", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "### 推理分析\n\n- **日主强弱**：日主乙木，生于丑月末（冬季），土旺木囚；地支丑、戌、辰三土结党，天干透辛金（七杀）、庚金（正官），全局土金成势，乙木无强根（仅辰中藏乙木余气、丑中藏癸水偏印为微弱生机），日主极弱，属“财多身弱”格，可能论从弱。\n- **调候与格局**：乙木冬生喜火，年干丙火伤官透出，坐戌土火库有根，暖局有力。丙火生土（财），财生官杀，形成“伤官生财、财生官”的流通。若以从弱论，用神为土、金、火，忌水、木；年柱丙戌为用神，祖上宫位得力，主祖辈有一定产业或父母有才能。\n- **出身家境**：年柱代表祖上、童年环境。丙火伤官为秀气，且为调候用神，暗示家庭并非贫困无依；但财星过旺为忌，日主弱不能担财，月柱辛丑七杀坐财，父母宫刑害（丑戌相刑），主家庭内部压力大、早年生活多有磨砺，不可能大富大贵。综合看，出身应为普通家庭，略近小康。\n- **特殊选项排除**：D选项“孤儿院”需父母星严重伤残或遗弃，原局印星（母）虽藏而不透，但丑中癸水为偏印、辰中癸水为印库，并未被彻底冲灭，故不成立；C选项“富贵家庭”则与日主弱、财旺为忌相悖，富屋贫人之象明显；A选项“贫穷”过于绝对，有丙火调候、伤官生财的组合，祖上不致一贫如洗。\n\n### 最终答案\nB", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 0.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "male_20070131_P008-Q37", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2024_b1a_prime_R0_P4_G4\\details_2024_b1a_prime_R0_P4_G4.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 35743, "response_id": "2dc1d777-a206-4a35-bea7-cfb7bdb45994", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 217, "completion_tokens": 1918, "total_tokens": 2135, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 1484}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 0, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 217}}
{"case_id": "male_20070131_P008-Q38", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主的身材外貌如何？", "expected_answer": "A", "predicted_answer": "A", "raw_answer": "### 分析推理\n\n命主八字为：丙戌 辛丑 乙丑 庚辰。日主乙木，生于丑月土旺之时，地支全为湿土、燥土（戌、丑、丑、辰），土厚木折，乙木无根，天干更有庚金正官、辛金七杀夹克，官杀混杂，日主极弱，属于从弱格（从财官）。\n\n从命理角度看：\n- **身材**：乙木为花草之木，本性柔韧，但地支无根且被众土耗泄、旺金克伐，木气衰极，难有高大魁梧之姿，多偏瘦或中等偏矮。土多本应敦厚，但官杀重克身，压力大，不易发胖，故身材倾向瘦或细长。\n- **皮肤**：天干丙火伤官透出，可暖局调候，但丙辛相合化为水，水有润泽之象；地支多湿土，亦有涵养，皮肤不会枯黄，反而可能偏白皙或洁净。\n- **五官气质**：乙木虽弱，但本性柔美，庚辛官杀透干，易有形貌清秀、骨感分明之象。丙辛合水，有灵秀之气；辰戌丑土重，五官可能立体但不粗犷，或见细眼薄唇，整体气质偏斯文、秀气而非威严粗糙。从官杀亦有自律之态，外表容易给人温文印象，而非其貌不扬或浓眉大眼的威猛型。\n- 综合判断，最符合“高瘦白皙、秀气温文”的描绘。\n\n### 最终答案\nA", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "male_20070131_P008-Q38", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2024_b1a_prime_R0_P4_G4\\details_2024_b1a_prime_R0_P4_G4.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 21380, "response_id": "a380809c-8e09-4882-a9dd-619c184da6ba", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 252, "completion_tokens": 1132, "total_tokens": 1384, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 762}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 0, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 252}}
